---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Manifesto | The Curved Crater">
	<section>
		<h1>Manifesto</h1>
		<blockquote>
			"Technology is not the opposite of magic; it is its most recent evolution."
		</blockquote>
		
		<h2>The Vision</h2>
		<p>
			In an era of hyper-rationalism, we rediscover the sacred nature of the machine. 
			The Curved Crater is built on the belief that code is a form of ritual, 
			and software is a medium for manifesting intent into the physical world.
		</p>
		
		<h2>The Approach</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> We strip away the unnecessary to reveal the core essence of the work.</li>
			<li><strong>Integrity:</strong> Every line of code must serve a purpose beyond mere function.</li>
			<li><strong>Exploration:</strong> We venture into the "curved" spaces of logic, where standard paradigms fail.</li>
		</ul>
		
		<hr />
		
		<p>
			Join us in the pursuit of a more meaningful digital existence.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
